ility.","modelStyling":"Polished, natural hair and makeup, consistent with a contemporary South Asian aesthetic. Model's hair should be styled to not obstruct the collar or neckline.","mood":"Elegant, vibrant, and commercially appealing, reflecting the fusion style of the garment.","photographyStyle":"High-key, clean, and sharp commercial e-commerce photography.","propUsage":"No props, to maintain focus solely on the product.","shadowStyle":"Minimal, soft, and subtle shadows that naturally fall and add slight depth without obscuring details.","studioEnvironment":"Modern, professional e-commerce studio setting."},"modelIdentity":{"bodyProportions":"Standard fashion model proportions that effectively showcase the garment's oversized fit and drape.","castingDirection":"Adult South Asian female fashion model.","face":"A recognizable, confident, and versatile face, capable of subtle, approachable expressions.","hair":"Dark, sleek, and well-maintained hair, styled in a manner that does not obscure the garment's neckline (e.g., straight, soft waves, or a neat low ponytail/bun if necessary). The style must be consistent across all shots.","makeup":"Natural and refined makeup, emphasizing eyes and lips without being overly dramatic or distracting from the product.","stylingLock":"The same adult South Asian female fashion model with identical face, skin tone, hair style, makeup, body proportions, bottom wear (light wash blue jeans as seen in reference images), and absent footwear or accessories (unless explicitly added by the prompt) will be used across all images."},"posePlan":[{"bodyPosition":"Model standing perfectly straight, shoulders squared to the camera, with a confident posture.","cameraAngle":"Eye-level, straight on.","consistencyNotes":"This pose establishes the locked model identity, hair, makeup, bottom wear, scene, and lighting for all subsequent images.","description":"A classic e-commerce hero shot presenting the garment squarely and fully from the front, esta